{"t": 1793318561521, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "stale_objective", "Objective 6 'Build a market stall' bar shows 'Wood 20/20 • Stone 5/5' (full, gold) right after building a Farm, but inventory is Wood 5 / Stone 0. Progress looks cached from before the farm spent 25 wood + 10 stone. Expected 5/20 and 0/5. Also the objective text box runs underneath the Inventory panel."]}
{"t": 1793318561989, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "winter_counter", "Season panel still says 'Autumn - day 1/2' and 'Winter in 2 days' after timeOfDay went 0.30 -> 0.55 (a quarter day) since the world started; chronicle meanwhile shows 'Day 5'. Day numbering differs between Season panel (day 1/2), chronicle (Day 5) and state.json (day 4); the countdown never ticks down to e.g. 1.5 days, so a player cannot gauge how long until winter."]}
{"t": 1793318562958, "cmd": "state", "args": []}
{"t": 1793318573878, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "perf", "Game ran at 3-11 ticks/s (50 is full speed) and 1-2 fps the whole session (host load avg ~95 on 20 cores with parallel sessions). With --season autumn the HUD says 'Winter in 2 days' = 20 game minutes = 60000 ticks; at ~6 tps that is ~2.8 h wall, so the 'survive the first winter' goal cannot be reached in a 35 min session. In 22 wall minutes only ~7600 ticks (2.5 game min) passed."]}
